"""
QUANT-NEXUS MULTI-STRADDLE DAEMON (NEXT-GEN V3.0 - MICROSTRUCTURE & NEXUS-OS INTEGRATED)
Five Core Pillars:
1. Volatility Regime Classification (V2 Normalized Feature Vector)
2. Dynamic ATR-Scaled Brackets (buffer = k1*ATR, sl = k2*ATR)
3. Spread Elasticity Filter (Rolling 90th percentile shield)
4. Microstructure Sentinel Gating (VPOC Anti-Chop + Quote-Shift Aggressor Delta Alignment)
5. Nexus-OS Anti-Whipsaw Quarantine + 4-Asset Total Book Cap + 13:30 Macro News Shield
"""
import sys
import os
